msgid "The ``Init PNO types`` flow loads the definitions of prior notification types (and the rules - species, FAO and GFCM areas, gears, flag states, minimum quantity... - which determine whether a PNO belongs to a type) from hard coded csv files stored in ``pipeline/src/data/`` into the ``pno_types`` and ``pno_type_rules`` tables."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/flows/init-pno-types.rst:9
#: 4be23eaf32d94f7bb28a6d73c4bf7274
msgid "PNO types are computed by the :doc:`enrich-logbook` flow and determine whether a PNO is in the verification scope of the FMC and its minimum notification period. See :doc:`../prior-notifications`."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/flows/init-pno-types.rst:12
